    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You can substitute a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_Computer\" title=\"Use Computer\">Use Computer</a> check for a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mechanics\" title=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</a> check when disabling a computerized device. The effort takes 1 minute and the DC is equal to the computer's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a>. In addition, whenever anyone accesses the afflicted computer using a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a> or another computer, that computer or Droid's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attitude\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attitude\">Attitude</a> immediately becomes Unfriendly.",
